Security Policy
-----------------

What to do when reporting a vulnerability:
If you discover a security issue in this project, please report it by opening a GitHub Issue:
https://github.com/tpiscoding/Rock-Paper-Scissors_Game/issues

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What to include:
- Issue Description
- How to reproduce the issue
- Known affected file/s (if known, if not it's okay to not include)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Response:
The project maintainer will review and respond to security reports as soon as humanely possible!
